From bfb343df6a7567ec1e91a8bd3ba5142d0bbd6f0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 06:01:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: 34 more applications

The second batch of HaikuArchives and haikuports applications prosepkg
built: A-Book, BookmarkConverter, Brie, BSAP, DebugMonitor, EmailViews,
FairTrade, FlyingTroll, FolderShaper, Fortuna, Globe, Havoc, HDialog,
KeyCursor, Microbe, Moe, MrPeeps, NightAndDay, OpenOriginPackage,
PhotoGrabber, PonyExpress, PPViewer, RemoteControl, RomanNumbers,
SuperPrefs, USBDeskbar, VWget, XRS, ConvertToLF, LockWorkstation,
WaveView, CherryBlossom, BeTeX, PecoBeat (with InternalMIDI), and the
libraries they need (taglib, libexif, libsndfile, libsamplerate).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0043-prose-profile-34-more-applications.patch 61e69182cd52f8b85ec23928ec5e4ccbc95e524cdc498abf71833a0b1efb0f63
